WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.752
The most important attribute I have built through this

00:00:03.752 --> 00:00:05.280
process is the mental.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.494
Because the mental is in a way the foundation

00:00:07.494 --> 00:00:09.560
for everything else that I have aimed for.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.920
My editing, training, it depends on the mentality you have.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.212
I didn't really have any structure, I didn't have

00:00:17.212 --> 00:00:20.034
any plan, I didn't have any routine that I

00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:20.639
followed.

00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.069
It took a big mental fall, and it also

00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:27.680
limited me to achieve my academic dream,

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.600
which was to achieve a grade of 11.8.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.119
I didn't have any way, I didn't have any structure.

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:37.634
And what you did was to build my mentality

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:40.480
up, structured from the bottom up.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.868
Now I'm much more effective, now I have more

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:45.039
time with my family, now I have a better

00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:45.799
mental health.

00:00:45.799 --> 00:00:50.080
And I feel healthy, both mentally, physically and spiritually.
